    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d397">

                <pb facs="0388" n="272" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg272"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 822.00/369.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consular Agent Hedian to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Esmeraldas</hi>
                        </placeName> [<date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-03-05"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Undated</hi></date><hi rendition="#italic">; Received March 5,
                            1914</hi>].</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Government, after ineffectual attacks Tuesday and last night, retired. Only one
                    gunboat remains in sight.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hedian</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
